# User Journey

![Wireframe](artefacts/wireframe-at2-ap.drawio.png)

For this wire frame an example of a user's journey could be:

1. Opens the application and clicks the menu on the home page
2. Navigates to the Video List/Video Player page
3. Extracts text from a frame
4. Navigates to the Extraction results page
5. Save the text from the extraction by downloading the .txt file
